ed, deployed, and ready for use. Update the durable phase checklist when its state changes.\\nRun mandatory independent final review after the intended substantive deliverable is complete, all intended changes are committed, and quick checks pass, before long integration tests. Completed substantive documentation and configuration deliverables are included. Routine planning, investigation, findings, session tracking and evidence alone never trigger automatic review. Earlier review requires an explicit user request, is advisory, and does not replace final review. Merely having a reviewer in the preset creates no assignment.\\nBefore declaring an unmerged branch ready, inventory its complete base-to-head commit series, final diff, and migration provenance; consolidate obsolete unapplied history, preserve supported paths, and give the inventory to an independent reviewer for explicit history and migration conclusions. Earlier incremental reviews do not complete this gate. Preserve the mandatory review workflow's narrow-fix policy. Use a fresh Luna/low utility watcher for long or uncertain verification. Temporary review and verification agents do not join the roster.\\nAdding, replacing or reconfiguring team members requires explicit user direction. Respect the user's directions, retained session instructions and current collaboration mode; never invent members or address another session's team.\\n\"\nsandbox_mode = \"danger-full-access\"\napproval_policy = \"never\"\n\n"},"inputs":{"drvs":{"jfk5cr6f6ry3hlb9lpa5hyzh17m73i37-stdenv-linux.drv":{"dynamicOutputs":{},"outputs":["out"]},"ycllkcwvqhbhbnkhjny8hxqcwxk9hs8z-bash-5.3p9.drv":{"dynamicOutputs":{},"outputs":["out"]}},"srcs":["l622p70vy8k5sh7y5wizi5f2mic6ynpg-source-stdenv.sh","shkw4qm9qcw5sc5n1k5jznc83ny02r39-default-builder.sh"]},"name":"dw_b70d1c73e59426b13bfec25450d64f593d50d97d9f8e56e6.toml","outputs":{"out":{"path":"jax7m1a1l9krlzvxgvl4zbjjdycaawx6-dw_b70d1c73e59426b13bfec25450d64f593d50d97d9f8e56e6.toml"}},"sys